            "file": "shop/views/__init__.py",
            "line": 1,
            "column": 1
          },
          "literal": "The views package. Every URLconf above imports from HERE and nothing is defined here.\n\nThe same re-export, one node type down. A registration names the class the way it was\nimported, and an application of any size imports from the package rather than from the\nmodule the class is written in: all 397 of plane's registrations do, which is why that\napplication's class-based views resolved to no verbs and produced no entry point at all.\n"
        }
      ],
